# Paste a fresh Auth0 access token here (variables are per file in REST Client)
@token = 0sFUgLUvU0yjMU7ja7cUf2KHUZCHbGrV@clients

### My profile → 404 until I register, then 200 (needs users-service running)
GET http://localhost:3000/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register my profile → 201 (auth0Id comes from the token, not the body)
POST http://localhost:3000/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "joaoo@example.com", "name": "Joãoo" }

### Register again → 409 from users-service, passed through by the gateway
POST http://localhost:3000/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "joao@example.com" }

### Stop users-service, then → 503
GET http://localhost:3000/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
